{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1193,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aac29ed4475686057710fdaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伸展运动完——成——！\r\n我呢，身体十分柔软哦！\r\n能弯到很下面呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "071a140f61729e1ce29a4f9ec79db7c994d2eb812c00a72d2854e5737c9e5d6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e9b57864225eb029fbcf876",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好——到训练的时间啦——！\r\n我厉害的地方，\r\n可要尽收眼底哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "515c9a435c3617a05220508e7e37344ca19f43cc2b9984efe50e8430bc8e7240",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a5a1d75af0661c8cfd74848",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在成为最强的赛马娘之前\r\n我都不会停下脚步哟！\r\n训练员你当然也和我一样对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e906014670c5a8ba3d20264f7c23c9f1b249e813d08f2fd511700ccc470b5f1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b4d3ea8892d6d8ed225f737",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以第1名冲线的话，就能听到\r\n只属于我的盛——大的欢呼声！\r\n为了这些欢呼声也要加油了哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb6090297934576fa0572d997b13eb15d1f543198c0c57058d69dfda9185ff0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bb51e48dfe3b8235f7a83be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我呢，不想输。\r\n不管是谁也好，自己也罢。一次都不想输！\r\n……那么。开始训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a10d565774f5703006be7664783e98900f6df001f7eba957d3b6c97655e1ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b3d4ec2bd945d7d4dfb305",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给我也安排非——常严格的训练吧！\r\n求你～了！\r\n因为会长好像也这么训练着呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8340915ca3978aeee5212db84d2845d28e6afce581d876acace0454fc37f5b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc466b72fea0f38e7983c5c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备OK！要燃起来了哟——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c43686eb1e8a8b686369ebbbc7c0f49ec4246fba57d578f4e6498f7a64d90cf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0f60cee863f4af669ea6912",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是严格的训练\r\n也放马过来吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b687f5f3d9dbc8398c42594345cb840d0fd4ce1c2d61c528e8ad6379a8c4627f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e351e6b8e2a437968f0253a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔姆，被拜托了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cc06ddd4bf4bad9d54eb4ad2e2e2375cf3b3971b088a83877bef4f8a05cf050",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a79bc2a429c93da636d60347",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以最强为目标 Let's Go！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aedaaa466e5bcb57a903dccffa70cf259a63d6618ddb9ba2e3465de3a805e1c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ae02cf0f387ca11e56564be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“总有一天会变得像一直注视着的会长一样，\r\n以压倒性的速度取胜”……！\r\n我，想要跑得更快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e87e92559873c9e1a72033b39ca3b39cc77f1661ba52ff7dedd2fd741d52cf9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9b358454f20d4d6917379d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题，就交给你啦！\r\n毕竟我们之间可是无需多言的关系、\r\n之类的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "42c1998be2ee5f1c9e3822a934c7b2a79b518144bce9195346b212da02b46728",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f87f6e3ac1ab4985ed1f31f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们可是会成为传说的！\r\n那超越了“最强”与“无敌”的最前方，\r\n一起见证吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "729f4df8be904ccbd9a70e78cb67211118223ce71e4442d9289f353d04bb41aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac3da291938f81a49a34569",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走るとね、袖もリボンも\r\nひらひら～って揺れるんだ。\r\n華麗なボクを見ててよねっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c45151b26c48d8bc44ed29eed1f48a2503ec99f88923d70122bb0958cd7ebb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b3085654715673cfed90f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ボクが目指すのは天地に轟くウマ娘\r\n――それまで止まる気なんて\r\nないからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09b0d5fef1a88b40e0cf96e8147cf58b0ce01a2aa1f0ef7f04fbd35ff2763300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:979f8cb895916fc4bf0785b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "厚底のクツでもヨユーヨユー♪\r\nむしろ雅に走っちゃうもんね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f73183dfeacbff42e562419dbe7868e60057b18ea7b790e1225f17af90ed1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a2d2cf6abd40648332ed7c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やあやあ、我こそは天下無双、\r\n誰より疾き帝王である！！\r\n…なんてね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c399001be05d51da9ba02cf45daa4145bee6a77d8eb108aa3864664512848e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f4a9b4a82758553feb33bdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ボクはいつだって『初志貫徹』！\r\n『最強無敵』を目指して行くぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa1b1cf89084d0ce7814aa8c0c94b74f3674867a7630a022176a8bad98ca968b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1a016b3e9f7dac9a7edffea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿吽の呼吸、っていうのかな。\r\nボクのやりたいこと、\r\n何でもわかってくれてるねっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2584d7723c6c7d1cdcd613c92d22127551357b2c43aff6f60d00be2be929b30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61d08afe649a50ecfa5d8a83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ボクたち、水魚の交わりって\r\nやつなのかも！…ボクから\r\n離れちゃダメだからねっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aded6bf660dd5b08ffd5c852b1477ede8997c74fa8b7294f21c75941657c635",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75a33247d2530d4fb80a8078",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无敌的帝王传说，用自己的实力证明了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef1ebd4097b7a2c47f3f3d953fd58326ca898509800accf6ddd453fc25f3e559",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aed47b2554c63c7dcef8a927",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们2人一起的话就是最强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6276b543ac10ea6c2c36ef47d9182526eb4f55aa60383ca91e04c1329c092ee2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04fa82c4f30b32eb41ac1b38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿！这样一来我们就是传说了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d2fa5d2d5286bdc437845403188c1c7d5e627ff25e3d7eb0ea0fd97908e511a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f08981c182c1655d06fcf5fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我变成了“最强”什么的……谢谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4244141150217c4154829778a5871612da461c0655250ade87d24f6f51e224b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d29d4e767e4269cbb96c076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キミと最高の物語を刻めたよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f039d969c8bc396dd5699ea0f77997490ff5248ecdc6c22db9592aa0107c788",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:857cc3bb921d9e0122e84f30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これぞ古今無双のテイオー様だーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "733d8a1937fa919f3ec63455205deb5410a42199da206da458ded0040c039f23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:888bcd25ea945994f9d6f2c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要成为无敌的帝王了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46074f1dcbea08dd6e2cd218cf598e0537fed90ab4a244a16091f00bc6b8b94c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3f849ea5e0db11349c0be7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的成长可是没有极限的哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab027fa7b39e244274a15197f4c94e18571e09943537ce35b7de342866f906a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78bb23985cd743f239020ca2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "东海帝王，要上了哟——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ad78227babf0ea8e9a15878fb0c61bd7f476c388a9dfe581536f3cb52427344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ff6978107a350bcda80a978",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无敌的帝王传说，\n就此启程！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2698055c1949fb406505a0b2841439e89e48515a1c2b4975d1ae5f5baf416975",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b223a7806e6d0083a73fe6d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再多依靠我一些也可以哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56229e911656ea0c923013b779c07e6438c79be333523464a301d646e507456c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de941d455333775fb33fc60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得我还有着上升潜力嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "78f6fff5e1aab713847c55e0dde3575eba07efcb1b9d3cffa6c6d48f78cbca1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79f067376e5e4c044c52b15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看快看！我又变得更强了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d2ea2ad5ac8d21ed71f99620f6deba7498b79db9834f950985fb7c6b11b8344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3830edccce102d7d44412bc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极限什么的和我可无缘啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "caa3a4c05e64462139e97f643750e50d0c7487661c24f6e81e746acb3544542e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40050f24d21dc14e9a0764c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对不会放弃的！我要……\r\n成为超越最强的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53b3cd35b8bcc6a53290e5b3e39e759d808c0bc96f9f189cbe949034e184d72b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bad9f886ad4160e9c778d0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最强不屈的赛马娘！东海帝王哒哟——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c770bdb670d2f90da550cda811af1f034b1a1faf6f8e19cc965373ac3e8a0e68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd400197611338ac5e907645",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっと極めるよーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9026986c71d511e3c07d67fb2a445007dd2629e28a16b3e09e7c3707f1682f83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f32a6963b1ec49d71624e417",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限界を超えたこの力、\r\nとくと御覧じろーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77f38799ae05cffea5b8fa400ae78ad9879577e1f6efa2a5fd1f155e95566d4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bd80a3e6ae626f7d1ffd21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "華やかに舞う胡蝶の如く――\r\n帝王、いざ参る！",
      "source_fingerprint": "198fe5d78d51156b9fdcca36988cfc8852b1265876ef8ada9e2ab3eb13b3c6cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72aad12d6e408940b2fa91a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トウカイテイオー、\r\nここに推参！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87994e1de79677643a26e5f5703f7c8e1e791bff2cd868318e5911c85d0270f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6707dc9f27d8b18f17ead85c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要全力冲刺咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d5cd906cd1a01d0e633db0c49bdeb93737cb6946e4ea3fdb0497c9206285502",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a179e2ddf0a6c2bea5fe1977",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我的跑姿会\r\n让人感到憧憬……\r\n那姐姐我就会更～加努力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da8f840d291c425ea55df54bff3ce72af69c95b9f88a8149aa8d0bc9c5b8747b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b3db1de12d5a0e3327fe518",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c82872d8a468c7ad7b36546080de7121f477614ca965a9aed5b1ce585843d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73e4ac7247b872fde5065998",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87b8214d3750432ce174fdd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你坐在副驾驶座的反应\r\n还真有趣呢……\r\n会让我想要开得再更快一点呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08200f4dd2c72d88b173041654119cdcf43b776bf1ae8f678819b0e5e41b3bdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8626ecd6844a8ce0e9f354e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是兜风还是比赛，\r\n我都会用超快速度带你到目的地。\r\n你可要好～好地待在我身边哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ba810fbdb7da8b7c2c19ce7d5addef85ab9dd108ed4ba47d0697c30b3e83cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d298225ec7507e740ae5d63e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n今年也想和训练员一起\r\n共度很棒的一整年呢，呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "289119cb66dcef521cd2e02c2c6b8c60af5607cc8c00b0364409781af0dc8820",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98244a9efccec24969a80641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后辈给了我巧克力，\r\n说是要感谢平时的照顾呢！\r\n大家真的都很可爱呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1cf331300ee6204e954005d7c4d3aa2f9aae4c2093d90a16824688f5891f097",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e729181e3b7e8de328d461a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给你，我亲手做的巧克力！\r\n里面包着我满满的爱心哦～\r\n这样你就对我更死心塌地了吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2f02ecc8f1bdae51858629465126a169d2cd2712aa3aedd4c9ddb94020ba20a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e37d33d0cb6964a08f6ae4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道可以清楚看见星星的地方哦。\r\n虽然有点远……但难得的七夕嘛，\r\n要不要开车去看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba30b2608d9f421fc8a17b66711f021a28cbcc900448ae3ba6bfdaf296da16a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0184eab4c5cd8015d15e2502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节快乐！比起吃点心，\r\n恶作剧好像更有趣呢……！\r\n开玩笑的啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6e5ac5b011aa96865e275755e38c415007ca8cec292923aa92b3accdd3b9a13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74d17f233bb3eeca9f78962",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐♪\r\n神圣的夜晚果然\r\n很令人兴奋呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1553a66cc9c416a4ae4bfdee10feabde7aba967801c467df3ffa0615ecf8e13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb0a0cd421e98690d9882d24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我很喜欢兜风，\r\n但悠闲地看彩灯也很棒呢。\r\n……今晚你有空吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c52253a58795d1d07167c1356f7a3c0bf44b4dc24fec1a52c480a7275fc0a3d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad433af67f642884421158c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是最棒的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8632b2475932891975d71f310c3bd7ac9bb48498542a79d87ff9ca6091b27805",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad4e741f9cddf404526191df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也快要过完了呢……\r\n自从遇见训练员之后，\r\n时间就过得好快呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a84f8b158faec6a00aeacb1388f6aa3692af7e5dd5e09cf1ab27e83c0672692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb805c5ed517669a1977d1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂喂，你希望我为你做什么呢？\r\n难得你生日嘛，\r\n都跟姐姐说说看♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "31e2f768565b06d405a0cb3295d634206d26ee5ff208c4d6fcd804d9277d31f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f123a02c5881c9dc7fa213d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n呵呵……你好像变得更可靠了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bee1cc924452d898062c6e82186731342bd78e1060a781c41bf0dd067fe66afa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8362f12cbeec42410ba87de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可爱的后辈们给了我\r\n好多的祝贺呢！\r\n呵呵，生日真是美好♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "98709cafe93c0d8f5adb40a0af8b5f0345e8da2d8bf26c5855e1e52e3274ec1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11b37e6566fb37fabe7ba14a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把今天的行程整个空下来了。\r\n……所以，你可以整天都\r\n帮我庆祝生日吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba334368020ce36c6090b8dcef6b9189f3e6abbbc28283a6ee9f4dc62c10b2ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:540a012f2a943b81b95f1293",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新的公告呢。\r\n你看过之后再告诉我\r\n是什么事吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "09366842b7c906cad725b306ed0b23f46634d1a00dede9d840526e99ef316185",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c58aab3c13660a18a01339c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到礼物了呢。\r\n不知道是什么东西，\r\n好期待呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dd57eb4c038df89baa9594f2aae95c03743dbcc01a6f121e7f0e25596e8e60a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af090746d4be799cf5eca313",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务好像达成了哦♪\r\n真不愧是训练员呢，\r\n那我就带你去兜风当作奖励吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e9545e4ce2323d135000918ca22262473770dc2f01443e65ea45b3f84902028",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:357f29fac9c096727c0f335e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像正在准备举办活动呢。\r\n训练员要记得把行程空出来哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ef0f620d130cc9acff208a30148145d19a12ed37df14de0e727c1f6bed326f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95aa02b9dbe70c29abf2fa64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像正在举办活动呢。\r\n喂喂，我们赶快过去看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21916b6af41c76589b9d4a7c327ec2bb8d553d87ab87d550bfb942117f59078c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62419e2fe978b04c7687bf85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我输了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "be75ef2ceadfbe7d34c8257778aca5e9e8d5eec946d714bf77f49a6d0dd375da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e11e2907f9452b2c50527c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8e74a358d0923d64c7f7f7b8c2dfe7be75620364ffe94d8f3945ced08f90a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb022bdc606d7fb95aefe00e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像制作人一样把针织衫披在肩膀上\r\n真的很酷炫对吧？\r\n时下流行的穿搭问我就对了?",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0c9a3b23beac0d34a02909d3aa6f9577f70bdf5f2016e2aaec182f7ce91b56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ec764cfcf4d3cb170d513f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我约会时一定会穿上这套衣服，\r\n或许可以说是另一套决胜服？\r\n……跟你说笑的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da360a861ccc29e3ccd4498d5315246b17ec80a591fed0aad72516c84594db16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f852a30d0d6076fa40b9bef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近热衷于周游高速公路休息站！\r\n但却始终找不到\r\n有卖汉堡的自动贩卖机呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b817c2185fc87063e64f387d23937300feda321e2d7c73392f4a2f69eefad341",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04874e679190d10f934849d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然是平手，太热血了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5153368fceb79072c1211dd3d8f958d311caab6daabdba2320a77bd246a3689b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e43b6dd5d5d63b3c67cd9773",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们赢了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bb827ebfa4a18f8a78bf6294b1a43d24dab38fb6d3a9f37700d6ec824589818",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1a6001d5ab10c6a750c0297",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我输了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "be75ef2ceadfbe7d34c8257778aca5e9e8d5eec946d714bf77f49a6d0dd375da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1edbc30890b226f92117fa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然是平手，太热血了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5153368fceb79072c1211dd3d8f958d311caab6daabdba2320a77bd246a3689b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:006f18015667863ea345bb59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新最高分了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bb1200d4604d70b9cb553975ed9225912b9c84da59e3bf28712b2ed3438f6df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2063fc60eb294b705ce78b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起来一场开心的比赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "687e9b20541c2fd32d3a4391dcd5fb9b99606f8163c17c19d2a87e93a902f94e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e4d1bbede656a216b4b89c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起加油吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "25c7335655d8b1b327022c54c53c9cb3f485d4806f12eea786b94bc17387bcbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
